    "Python Optimized Code",
    "3.6",
    "Compiled Python program, similar to a.PYC file, but assert statements and SET_LINENO instructions are removed. Windows Python Software Foundation Python. Mac Python Software Foundation Python. Linux Python Software Foundation PythonFree.",
    "Windows Python Software Foundation Python. Mac Python Software Foundation Python. Linux Python Software Foundation Python.",
